    "finalName": "",
    "description": "When you <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fight_Defensively\" title=\"Fight Defensively\">Fight Defensively</a>, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a> you can negate a melee attack by making a successful <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unarmed\">Unarmed</a> attack roll. If your attack roll equals or exceeds the attack roll of the incoming melee attack, the attack is negated. You must be aware of the attack, and not be <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flat-Footed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flat-Footed\">Flat-Footed</a>, and you take a cumulative -2 penalty to all attack rolls for each attack roll made since the beginning of your last turn.",
